# B3 parser and outputter

Kerry N. Wood (kerry.wood@asterism.ai)

April 2023

*Updated June 2026*

This is Python-only code to parse and generate B3 formats for obs.

It does *not* do any coordinate conversions or internal processing.  

You have to do that outside the parser and serializer.

This parser should handle most versions of B3 

### Testing

A test set was generated via the AstroStandards and this is tested against it.

